  "solution": "**LOGIC: (First number × second number)/3 = Third number**\n\n(12, 14, 56) → (12 × 14)/3 = 4 × 14 = 56\n\nNow, check each option,\n\n**1) (16, 18, 96) → (16 × 18)/3 = 16 × 6 = 96 **\n\n2) (24, 16, 214) → (24 × 16)/3 = 8 × 16 = 128 ≠ 214\n\n3) (10, 16, 82) → (10 × 16)/3 = 160/3 = 53.33 ≠ 82\n\n4) (14, 20, 145) → (14 × 20)/3 = 280/3 = 93.33 ≠ 145\n\nHence, the correct answer is **(16, 18, 96)**.",
